  "question": "Which gallery are available within a 40 kilometers radius on the route toward Hotel Zelos San Francisco, San Francisco, CA?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.468617 37.804932)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.4055 37.785286)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'gallery'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.468617 37.804932)',4326)::geography, 40000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.468617 37.804932)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
